 How to Run the Website Locally
Method 1: Direct File Open (Easiest)
Navigate to the project directory: c:\Users\HP\Desktop\Mobile Banking.
Double-click index.html or right-click index.html -> Open with Google Chrome (or Edge / Firefox).
The application will immediately load with full functionality.
Method 2: Python Local Web Server
Open PowerShell or Command Prompt in the project folder:
cd "c:\Users\HP\Desktop\Mobile Banking"
Start Python's built-in web server:
python -m http.server 8000
Open your browser and navigate to:
http://localhost:8000
Method 3: One-Click Windows Batch Script
Double-click the included run-local.bat script.
It will launch the local server and automatically open your default browser.
